{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_9","type":"agent_message","text":"Removed legacy deposit support from the models, pricing, public exports, and tests.\n\n`notifyHook` receives the booking total for each creation, including each group member, and the refund amount for each cancellation. Hooks run before commit. A thrown hook propagates the original error and aborts the entire booking write. Same-service booking writes are blocked during callbacks to protect the pending operation. Side effects from a callback that already ran can survive a later group hook failure.\n\n`node benchmarks/sources/ev2_ts_bookings/run_checks.mjs` exited 0. All 26 tests passed."}}
